  You can publish the game.
  You can put a license on the game.
  You have full liability on the game.

-Forking:
  You can fork this game, but you have to change the assets, & give credit in the "README" file.
  You can publish the fork.
  You can modify the license or you can replace the license.
  You have full liability on the Fork.

-Modding:
  You are allowed to make Mods for the game, by coding it by yourself or using a software for it.
  You can post it free or not for free.
  You can put a license on the mod.
  You can modify the game, can't do:(Crashing the game forcibly without a setting, Banning people from a world without a setting), can do:(fix bugs, modifying the game to be more optimized, 
add textures/sounds/music/blocks/items/tools/dimensions/biomes/functions/structures/world settings/config/controls, changing biomes, make lore, change lore).
  You are liable for any damages the mod does.

Español(Spanish):
